          "response": {
            "status": 428,
            "headers": {},
            "body_base64": ""
          }
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "outcome": "error"
      },
      "note": "428 means this client sent no guard at all. That is a bug in the client, not a race, so it must not be retried quietly: retrying would loop, and treating it as success would be a lie."
